| Output | 8-bit DAC $\in(0V, 5V)$ |
| Constant | $v_{sound} = 340m \pm 13\%\text{error}$)  |


**Design Constraints**

* System clock frequency is fixed and known
* Echo signal may be asynchronous to the system clock
* Maximum measurable distance is 25.5mm

